%%{init: {'theme':'dark'}}%%
sequenceDiagram
  participant EXT as Externe Quelle<br/>(MIDI-Clock/Link/Audio)
  participant SYNC as Sync-Engine
  participant MOD as Module<br/>(Seq/Looper/Vocoder)
  participant IO as Audio-I/O

  EXT->>SYNC: Onsets / Clock-Ticks
  Note over SYNC: Konfidenz-Gate (≥0,5)<br/>PLL re-anchor auf konfidenten Beat
  SYNC->>SYNC: setTempo + alignDownbeat
  loop jeder Block
    MOD->>SYNC: getStateAt(audioTime)
    SYNC-->>MOD: bpm · beat · bar · phase01
    MOD->>IO: trigger / buffer (sync-konsistent)
  end
  Note over MOD: keine eigene Uhr — Sync ist einziger Synchronisierer